        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Approximately 8–10 superficial erosions, 0.5–2 cm, erythematous, some with collarette scale and light honey crust at the edges; mild surrounding erythema. No increased warmth, induration or fluctuance. No intact bullae currently."
      }
